2026-05-24 21:39:11.764 [info] [requirements-analyzer] Received item -  {"requirementId":"REQ-14.5","question":"When validation passes (both checksum and HMAC are valid), what is the relationship with I/O operations? Should validation passing mean I/O hasn't occurred yet, or should I/O occurring mean validation must have already passed?","answerChoices":[{"answer":"Validation passing means I/O hasn't occurred yet","consequence":"The system enforces that I/O operations are strictly forbidden once validation completes."},{"answer":"I/O occurring means validation must have already passed","consequence":"The system allows I/O operations to proceed after successful validation."}],"defaultChoice":{"answer":"I/O occurring means validation must have already passed"},"responseType":"CLARIFYING_QUESTIONS","autoResolvable":true,"recommendedAnswer":"I/O occurring means validation must have already passed"}
